{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 2.0, "text": "Me voló la cabeza cuando Nietzsche dijo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 2.0, "end_seconds": 5.300000190734863, "text": "El que ve demasiado, acaba no encajando en ningún sitio", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 5.300000190734863, "end_seconds": 7.300000190734863, "text": "Y esa es la paradoja de la conciencia", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 7.300000190734863, "end_seconds": 9.800000190734863, "text": "Una vez que empiezas a ver más área de la superficie", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 9.800000190734863, "end_seconds": 11.800000190734863, "text": "El mundo ya no parece tan sencillo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 11.800000190734863, "end_seconds": 13.800000190734863, "text": "Empiezas a ver los juegos que juega la gente", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 13.800000190734863, "end_seconds": 16.799999237060547, "text": "La confianza falsa, sus motivos ocultos", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 16.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 19.799999237060547, "text": "Y empiezas a darte cuenta que la sociedad está formada por un montón de mentiras", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 19.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 21.799999237060547, "text": "Y que todo el mundo lleva una máscara", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 21.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 23.799999237060547, "text": "Y cuando lo ves por primera vez no puedes dejar de verlo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 23.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 25.799999237060547, "text": "Y luego cuando hablas a la gente sobre ello", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 25.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 27.799999237060547, "text": "La gente dice que estás pensando demasiado", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 27.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 29.799999237060547, "text": "Que estás delirando, que estás loco", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 29.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 31.799999237060547, "text": "Que así no funcionan las cosas", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 31.799999237060547, "end_seconds": 33.79999923706055, "text": "Que eres demasiado pesimista", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 33.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 35.79999923706055, "text": "Así que lo que haces es dejar de hablar", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 35.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 37.79999923706055, "text": "Empiezas simplemente a observar", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 37.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 39.79999923706055, "text": "Y cuando empiezas a observar", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 39.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 41.79999923706055, "text": "Dejas de sentirte parte del colectivo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 41.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 43.79999923706055, "text": "Dejas de ser parte del juego", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 43.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 45.79999923706055, "text": "No porque seas mejor que los demás", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 45.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 47.79999923706055, "text": "Sino porque sabes lo que está pasando", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 47.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 49.79999923706055, "text": "Lo ves todo y simplemente no puedes formar parte de ello", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 49.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 51.79999923706055, "text": "La conciencia te aísla", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 51.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 53.79999923706055, "text": "Pero ese es justamente el precio de la claridad", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 53.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 55.79999923706055, "text": "Y puede que pierdas a la multitud", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "AfTkeVQ00i0", "segment_index": 26, "start_seconds": 55.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 57.79999923706055, "text": "Pero te encontrarás a ti mismo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
